        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 200
       }
      }
     },
     "required": [
      "needs"
     ]
    },
    "description": "Find catalog items for things you need, named in words with the sizes that matter. Returns per need whether the catalog has the thing exactly, closely or not at all, with each match's exact ID, revision, name and catalog sizes.",
    "expected_return": {
     "format": "json",
     "contract": "status ok, or why not; per need in the order asked: need, match (exact, close or none) and items, each with material_id, material_revision, name, profile, fastener (kind or null), counting for fasteners, sizes as catalog text and project_own; list_complete false when the list was cut. Code copies each item's values from the catalog and drops anything not on the list; a need left without a valid item is none. unavailable is not proof of absence."
    },
    "card_description": "Use when a construction needs catalog items for its parts or joints. Gives, per need named in words, exact, close or no matches with each item's ID, revision, name and catalog sizes.",
    "optional_parameters": [],
    "required_parameters": [
     "needs"
    ],
    "additional_description": "Name each thing and the sizes you need, one need per thing; the finder matches words to this project's material list and does not choose for a purpose. Put all of a job's needs in one call where you can: every call reads the whole list. close is the same kind of thing at another size or variant; whether it will do is your call. Copy the IDs and revisions it returns."
   }
  },
