     "how_to": "Name each thing and the sizes you need, one need per thing; the finder matches words to this project's material list and does not choose for a purpose. Put all of a job's needs in one call where you can: every call reads the whole list. close is the same kind of thing at another size or variant; whether it will do is your call. Copy the IDs and revisions it returns.",
